<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Sun Wu">
  <data key="d0">Sun Wu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Sun Wu is a strategist who analyzed the geographical characteristics of the Chu State and recommended specific military training.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun Wu is an ancient Chinese military strategist who discussed the importance of terrain in warfare.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun Wu is a military strategist who analyzed six types of terrain in the geography chapter of his work.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun Wu was a famous military strategist who emphasized the importance of knowing weather and terrain in warfare.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-34a910155a4ca89cef37c9d03aa719e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca32d9edb8f2ea2552786cd5c0728420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53b857a7a2228ebfb7b675b22c9e4c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4</data>
