<node id="Falklands War">
  <data key="d0">Falklands War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Falklands War is a modern conflict where British forces successfully operated in the Malvinas Islands due to prior climate training.&lt;SEP&gt;The Falklands War was a 1982 conflict between the United Kingdom and Argentina involving naval combat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-34a910155a4ca89cef37c9d03aa719e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d7d1f88fe246b51fd0303547d9be8d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
