<node id="Anti-Japanese Base Area">
  <data key="d0">Anti-Japanese Base Area</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-Japanese Base Area refers to mountainous regions like Changbai and Taihang used for establishing defense and rear bases during resistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-34a910155a4ca89cef37c9d03aa719e0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779513334</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Artillery">
  <data key="d0">Artillery</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Artillery refers to gun-based weaponry and troops whose movement and deployment are significantly restricted by mountainous terrain and waterlogged fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Artillery accuracy is negatively impacted by strong winds and vertical air currents.&lt;SEP&gt;Artillery is a military branch where meteorological conditions affect shell trajectory and firing accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Fire support units whose operations are impacted by weather factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-34a910155a4ca89cef37c9d03aa719e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04fe3e063b1934b10a4b54c4167a8091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4069171df455529318ba9f6a609d862c</data>
