</node>
<node id="Yellow Sea">
  <data key="d0">Yellow Sea</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Yellow Sea is one of the five major sea areas constituting China's maritime territory.&lt;SEP&gt;The Yellow Sea serves as a front post for important political and economic regions including Beijing, Tianjin, Northeast, and North China.&lt;SEP&gt;A sea on the eastern side of the Liaodong Peninsula relevant to strategic defense.&lt;SEP&gt;The body of water into which part of the Huai River flows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d0b92052b83239097e641b25dcb4c198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98aa0a6c316255cf19e5c64b2770f024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5526035222e5349787e63203c8c751d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8838d954c1b9dee27b68282526f5d2fe</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
