<node id="US Military">
  <data key="d0">US Military</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The US Military is described as a modern opponent with alliance forces, against whom the Chinese forces adjusted their strategies during the Korean conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;The US Military utilized B-29 bombers for strategic missions, such as the 1944 bombing operation targeting Japanese industrial sites.&lt;SEP&gt;The armed forces of the United States that developed space weather research and strategic planning systems.</data>
