<node id="Turbulence">
  <data key="d0">Turbulence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Turbulence refers to atmospheric instability that can cause flight difficulties, instrument failure, and pilot fatigue, particularly at altitudes between 3000 and 6000 meters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ce0f8847579bcd84ebc6d7ccd5e3df71</data>
