<node id="Sun">
  <data key="d0">Sun</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">A celestial body acting as a major infrared radiation source that affects missile guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;The celestial body emitting ultraviolet radiation that affects the ground when ozone protection is reduced.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sun is the source of solar flares and X-ray bursts that trigger ionospheric disturbances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-543b6633702af343c0b0d5a3a6321a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd4b77ddbad65d9e33f870d31b0a2ed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86b3997480c8d2d8abb49b09b2247575</data>
