<node id="Gulf War">
  <data key="d0">Gulf War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Gulf War was a 1990 conflict where weather conditions tested both sides and meteorological data was crucial for the coalition forces.&lt;SEP&gt;A 1990 conflict that demonstrated the critical impact of weather conditions on combatants.&lt;SEP&gt;The Gulf War was a conflict where precision-guided weapons were extensively used but hampered by adverse weather conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A conflict in 1991 where satellite communication was unexpectedly affected by ionospheric scintillation events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-543b6633702af343c0b0d5a3a6321a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd4b77ddbad65d9e33f870d31b0a2ed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28b68cb8b3fe687d054eb5d09604e0ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d7d1f88fe246b51fd0303547d9be8d</data>
