<node id="Space Weather">
  <data key="d0">Space Weather</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Space Weather encompasses natural phenomena like solar wind and magnetic storms that threaten space assets and human health.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental conditions in space that impact technology and require monitoring and forecasting for safety.</data>
