<node id="Ionospheric Scintillation">
  <data key="d0">Ionospheric Scintillation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ionospheric scintillation causes rapid fluctuations in signal phase and amplitude, leading to significant navigation and positioning errors.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific atmospheric phenomenon causing random changes in signal strength and phase that affects navigation and communication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-543b6633702af343c0b0d5a3a6321a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c0dfe1adf2b5c68db487a859f79f7a</data>
