<node id="Near-Sea Defense">
  <data key="d0">Near-Sea Defense</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Near-Sea Defense is a strategic policy guiding the construction of naval forces to safeguard China's maritime rights and national security.</data>
