<node id="Ryukyu Islands">
  <data key="d0">Ryukyu Islands</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The waters through the Ryukyu Islands act as a throat channel for China's access to the Pacific Ocean.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ryukyu Islands are a geographical group utilized in the formation of the island chain strategy against mainland China.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ryukyu Islands are a geographic component utilized by the United States to form the Island Chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-98aa0a6c316255cf19e5c64b2770f024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79980cadb14f8eecf17a7424058f80a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a1e273402d0c5079e17bc3f132e9d2</data>
