  <data key="d5">1779513341</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ussuri River">
  <data key="d0">Ussuri River</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ussuri River joins the Heilongjiang River to form part of China's eastern boundary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ussuri River bordered the northeastern extent of China's territory historically, reaching beyond Sakhalin Island.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ussuri River forms a boundary between Northeast China and the Russian Primorye region.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ussuri River is a natural boundary separating the Northeast Region from the Russian Far East.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-98aa0a6c316255cf19e5c64b2770f024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8838d954c1b9dee27b68282526f5d2fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a1e273402d0c5079e17bc3f132e9d2</data>
