  <data key="d0">Japan Sea</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Japan Sea is a body of water accessible through the Korean Strait from China's sea areas.&lt;SEP&gt;The Japan Sea is a body of water controlled by the Russian Navy for fleet operations.</data>
