<node id="Northeast Region">
  <data key="d0">Northeast Region</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Northeast Region is a part of China where temperatures range from 0 to 6°C during the spring season.&lt;SEP&gt;The Northeast Region is a strategic area in China bordered by the Ussuri River and faces the Russian Far East.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79980cadb14f8eecf17a7424058f80a</data>
