  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Russian Far East includes the southeastern Primorye region which serves as a strategic naval base.&lt;SEP&gt;The Russian Far East is a region bordering Northeast China across the Heilongjiang River.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a1e273402d0c5079e17bc3f132e9d2</data>
