  <data key="d0">Southeast Asia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Southeast Asia is a geopolitical area on the Eurasia Continent affected by regional instability and conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Southeast Asia is a region whose shipping routes to other continents pass through the South China Sea.&lt;SEP&gt;Southeast Asia is a region traversed by the Unstable Arc proposed by the United States.</data>
