<node id="Xisha Islands">
  <data key="d0">Xisha Islands</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Xisha Islands are islands in the South China Sea that are considered Chinese territory but were claimed by Vietnam.&lt;SEP&gt;The Xisha Islands are a group of islands located in the western South China Sea.</data>
