<node id="Nansha Islands">
  <data key="d0">Nansha Islands</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Nansha Islands are an archipelago in the South China Sea marking China's southernmost territorial waters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nansha Islands are islands in the South China Sea that are considered Chinese territory but were occupied by Vietnam and others.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nansha Islands are a group of islands located in the southern South China Sea.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53b857a7a2228ebfb7b675b22c9e4c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8838d954c1b9dee27b68282526f5d2fe</data>
