  <data key="d0">Information Warfare</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Information warfare involves cognitive control of the battlefield environment where weather prediction plays a role.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276</data>
