<node id="Missile">
  <data key="d0">Missile</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Missile is identified as a primary weapon capable of striking residential areas as strategic targets in modern warfare.&lt;SEP&gt;Missiles are weapons whose launch and operation are affected by weather conditions like cumulonimbus clouds.&lt;SEP&gt;Missiles are weapons whose launch safety and trajectory can be impacted by weather conditions such as strong winds and rain.&lt;SEP&gt;A weapon system affected by solar infrared radiation and ocean environment conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Missile is a weapon system whose launch, flight, and accuracy are significantly influenced by wind and atmospheric density.&lt;SEP&gt;Missiles are weapon systems whose flight and accuracy are significantly affected by atmospheric conditions like wind and lightning.&lt;SEP&gt;Missile is a delivery vehicle used to transport substances like Freon or nitrogen oxides into the upper atmosphere.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd4b77ddbad65d9e33f870d31b0a2ed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04fe3e063b1934b10a4b54c4167a8091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c80ee723bcf749b452d4339be150476c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-003994fca557bfd14758df9f40939adf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86b3997480c8d2d8abb49b09b2247575</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779513343</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aircraft">
  <data key="d0">Aircraft</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Aircraft flight safety and performance are influenced by meteorological factors such as wind and visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircraft are military assets whose flight safety and performance are significantly affected by weather conditions like fog and ice.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircraft is aviation equipment impacted by weather factors including wind, icing, turbulence, and visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Flying machines whose safety, task completion, visibility, and structural integrity are impacted by cloud cover and icing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Aircraft includes jets that experience thrust changes due to water entering turbine compressors and landing distance changes due to runway friction.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircraft are used in air observation for visual and instrument reconnaissance of weather conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5dc9a717a7af0db2944d497cc6ed8276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2d9cecd6bfddf0136042457124e4ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04fe3e063b1934b10a4b54c4167a8091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d401bd037e25faec28496db8f738e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf7b6b975f6c62ad2f6664872c40e85</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779513343</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
