<node id="Submarine">
  <data key="d0">Submarine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Submarine is a naval vessel designed for underwater navigation, whose operational depth and speed are affected by sea water density and wave conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A Submarine is a naval vessel capable of surface travel at 5.5 to 10 meters depth and submerged travel at approximately 30 meters depth.&lt;SEP&gt;A vessel whose operation is significantly influenced by seawater density and internal ocean waves.&lt;SEP&gt;The Submarine is a naval vessel that operates underwater and is influenced by surface weather conditions changing hydrological layers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd4b77ddbad65d9e33f870d31b0a2ed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c80ee723bcf749b452d4339be150476c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9f0cdb472c694c1c46ee77bdf461b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2da0b5a925efce063af9f298932751</data>
