  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhuge Liang was a strategist who analyzed the geographical situation of Jingzhou and Yizhou to propose a unification strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhuge Liang was a strategist known for using fog to borrow arrows from Cao Cao's camp.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273c61bc25c3835cb71ff0cd7a221bf0</data>
