  <data key="d0">Second World War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Second World War serves as a historical reference point for changes in national battlefield preparation strategies and fortification focus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Second World War was a global conflict where weather conditions were utilized by the Japanese Army for surprise attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Second World War highlighted the critical role of meteorological support in major campaigns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cb8c96ba6affc4bd44f5647b2408ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c596f93a800f01604d14372afd18ffb</data>
