<node id="Chemical Agents">
  <data key="d0">Chemical Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical agents have their lethal effectiveness reduced by fog through condensation and settling.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical agents include substances like mustard gas that persist longer in winter and are affected by temperature inversion, rainfall, and wind.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc2492438202366534ec0b3b980991e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d401bd037e25faec28496db8f738e15</data>
