<node id="Heavy Rain">
  <data key="d0">Heavy Rain</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Heavy Rain is a weather event capable of causing floods that damage military facilities and infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Heavy rain and continuous rainfall lead to soil erosion, mudslides, and mountain floods.</data>
