<node id="Meteorological Satellite">
  <data key="d0">Meteorological Satellite</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Meteorological Satellites are advanced tools used by militaries to observe weather zones and provide critical data for operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Meteorological Satellites are part of the space-based detection systems within military atmospheric monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Meteorological satellite is a tool used for air observation to detect atmospheric states.&lt;SEP&gt;Meteorological Satellites are specialized satellites launched from space to probe the atmosphere and transmit cloud maps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28b68cb8b3fe687d054eb5d09604e0ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d401bd037e25faec28496db8f738e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cb8c96ba6affc4bd44f5647b2408ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3686ef7d1a69d62cc7ebfa12005763f9</data>
