  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High-tech War refers to future warfare scenarios requiring precise meteorological information support and technological adaptability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28b68cb8b3fe687d054eb5d09604e0ff</data>
