<node id="Navy">
  <data key="d0">Navy</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Navy is a military branch developed by coastal nations but restricted for inland nations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Navy conducts operations significantly influenced by marine conditions including coasts, islands, water depth, and seabed quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Navy is a military branch whose operations and training are influenced by meteorological conditions and studied by military meteorology.&lt;SEP&gt;Naval forces influenced by weather conditions during maritime operations.</data>
