<node id="Air Force">
  <data key="d0">Air Force</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Air Force is a military branch often developed by coastal nations alongside the Navy.&lt;SEP&gt;Air Force is a military branch affected by weather factors such as wind, clouds, and icing during aviation operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Air forces that require meteorological support for flight missions.&lt;SEP&gt;A military branch whose activities occur primarily in the air and are directly and significantly affected by weather conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Air Force is a military branch for which aviation weather forecasts are specifically prepared for flight planning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-04fe3e063b1934b10a4b54c4167a8091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273c61bc25c3835cb71ff0cd7a221bf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3686ef7d1a69d62cc7ebfa12005763f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4069171df455529318ba9f6a609d862c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf7b6b975f6c62ad2f6664872c40e85</data>
