  <data key="d0">Warship</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Warship is a surface combat vessel whose navigation, stability, and weapon deployment are significantly influenced by sea waves, currents, and tides.&lt;SEP&gt;Warship is naval equipment affected by meteorological elements such as temperature, sea fog, and wind during navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;A Warship is a combat vessel susceptible to damage from typhoons, storms, and large wind waves.</data>
