  <data key="d0">Landing Operation</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Landing operations require specific meteorological conditions and often involve compromises between different military branches.&lt;SEP&gt;A joint military action involving army, navy, air force, and strategic missile forces that is highly dependent on weather conditions.</data>
