<node id="Aircraft Carrier">
  <data key="d0">Aircraft Carrier</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Aircraft Carrier is a major combat vessel that began equipping jet aircraft and nuclear weapons in the mid-20th century.&lt;SEP&gt;An Aircraft Carrier is a naval vessel requiring a sea depth of approximately 9.5 to 11.5 meters for safe passage.&lt;SEP&gt;An Aircraft Carrier is a naval vessel that requires specific wind conditions facing forward for aircraft takeoff and landing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c80ee723bcf749b452d4339be150476c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c596f93a800f01604d14372afd18ffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f2da0b5a925efce063af9f298932751</data>
