  <data key="d0">Ocean Seabed Quality</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ocean Seabed Quality influences anchor holding power for ships and equipment, with clay and silt providing the best grip and rock the worst.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c80ee723bcf749b452d4339be150476c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779513371</data>
