<node id="Red Army">
  <data key="d0">Red Army</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Red Army was the military force in the early revolutionary period, known for adopting guerrilla warfare tactics due to limited resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Red Army was a military organization characterized as small and opposed to the powerful Kuomintang during the land revolution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-273c61bc25c3835cb71ff0cd7a221bf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd22db232a2593a19ce46cb27abefe9</data>
