<node id="War of Resistance Against Japan">
  <data key="d0">War of Resistance Against Japan</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The War of Resistance Against Japan involved the Eighth Route Army and New Fourth Army fighting Japanese and puppet armies using guerrilla and mobile warfare.&lt;SEP&gt;This war from 1937 to 1945 resulted in victory for China after implementing a protracted war strategy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-273c61bc25c3835cb71ff0cd7a221bf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd22db232a2593a19ce46cb27abefe9</data>
