<node id="Outer Space">
  <data key="d0">Outer Space</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Outer Space has become a potential fourth battlefield for military activities beyond land, sea, and air due to aerospace technology development.&lt;SEP&gt;Outer Space is mentioned as a potential starting point for future warfare involving missiles and nuclear weapons targeting military and industrial sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Outer Space is identified as an area where military geography research needs to expand.&lt;SEP&gt;Outer Space is the strategic high ground and operational environment for modern military conflicts and satellite activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-273c61bc25c3835cb71ff0cd7a221bf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c596f93a800f01604d14372afd18ffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd22db232a2593a19ce46cb27abefe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12c0dfe1adf2b5c68db487a859f79f7a</data>
