<node id="Biological Weapons">
  <data key="d0">Biological Weapons</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Biological Weapons are mentioned as armaments whose usage effects can be influenced by wind and weather.&lt;SEP&gt;Biological Weapons are military tools whose utility is lowered due to humidity and rain.&lt;SEP&gt;Biological weapons are armaments whose dispersion and effectiveness depend heavily on meteorological conditions.</data>
