  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemical Weapons are mentioned as armaments whose usage effects can be influenced by wind and weather.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical Weapons are military tools whose effectiveness is reduced by rainy weather conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemical weapons are armaments whose vaporization, spread, and concentration are influenced by temperature and wind.</data>
