<node id="Modern Meteorological Science">
  <data key="d0">Modern Meteorological Science</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Modern Meteorological Science is the scientific discipline established in the 17th century to objectively study weather and support military activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Modern Meteorological Science emerged in the 17th century and developed alongside military activity needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-003994fca557bfd14758df9f40939adf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88cb8c96ba6affc4bd44f5647b2408ac</data>
