  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Turkey is a nation state that participated in a multi-nation war against Russia in the mid-19th century.&lt;SEP&gt;Turkey was involved in the Crimean War alongside Russia.&lt;SEP&gt;Turkey was a nation allied with Britain and France in the Crimean War against Russia.</data>
