  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">France is the country containing Paris, used as a reference point for temperature comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;France is a nation state that allied with other nations in a mid-19th century war against Russia.&lt;SEP&gt;France participated in the Crimean War against Russia.</data>
