<node id="China">
  <data key="d0">China</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">China is a nation located in eastern Eurasia and west of the Pacific Ocean, featuring vast land and maritime territories with extensive land borders. Its terrain is complex, characterized by three steps descending from west to east, and includes numerous rivers and lakes that significantly influence economic development, national defense, and military actions. The country encompasses critical river basins and watersheds, hosting the majority of the Heilongjiang River's course and the Five Major Lake Regions. Furthermore, its maritime territory comprises five major sea areas, which hold strategic value analyzed within military geography.

From a strategic perspective, China faces potential threats from the north and neighboring powers, being surrounded by the Island Chain and included within the Unstable Arc. Some analytical texts refer to China as 'our country,' highlighting how northern threats influence strategic defense policies and the adaptation of battlefield preparation locations from the eastern coast to the Three North Regions. Notably, territory north of the traditional habit line was included in the McMahon Line claim. As a large nation with abundant resources and a massive population, China is deemed capable of sustaining a long-term war.

Climatically, China experiences diverse precipitation and temperature patterns across the Eurasian Continent. Owing to its strategic position and large population, it maintains significant influence on world peace and stability. Technical records indicate that shortwave communication within the country was blocked by a major solar X-ray outbreak in 2001. Collectively, these geographical, demographic, and strategic factors define China's complex role in regional security and global affairs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d0b92052b83239097e641b25dcb4c198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-543b6633702af343c0b0d5a3a6321a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca32d9edb8f2ea2552786cd5c0728420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98aa0a6c316255cf19e5c64b2770f024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53b857a7a2228ebfb7b675b22c9e4c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0062bd3dbcdf5b7c925a5e3266bd885c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273c61bc25c3835cb71ff0cd7a221bf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2a34c49c188ba9a655c3c10d21458c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6540ee1693bb1952ff5f0c0a29a6cfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2067a05006e92d59f8bbb55189a87ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8838d954c1b9dee27b68282526f5d2fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb7c5877c55d5fba2943b2f7e8e86409&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c596f93a800f01604d14372afd18ffb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b3394b9b4e98f146bc3091517249c5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd22db232a2593a19ce46cb27abefe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9f0cdb472c694c1c46ee77bdf461b98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79980cadb14f8eecf17a7424058f80a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53a1e273402d0c5079e17bc3f132e9d2</data>
